WEBVTT

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:06.740
Since ancient times, Great Japan's gentlemen have had a certain, special power.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:10.290
The power of the general. It is a power which brings out the innate ability of a samurai to its greatest potential.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:14.330
General

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:16.330
The power of the general. It is a power which brings out the innate ability of a samurai to its greatest potential.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:17.880
Samurai

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:23.420
The ultimate samurai, who formed a contract with a general, were known as "master samurai."

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:25.640
Master Samurai

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:29.810
However, the abilities of recent samurai have been deteriorating,

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:34.270
and only a handful of master samurai exist in Great Japan today.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:41.820
But! At this moment, Great Japan shall bear witness to the birth of another master samurai!

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:33.550
Wh-Who are you...?

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:35.810
My name is...

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:36.890
Yagyuu Jyuubei.

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:38.230
Yagyuu?

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:40.900
You were called Yagyuu Muneakira-san, correct?

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:45.400
For violating Academy Entrance Supervision Law, being an affront to public morality,

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:49.280
and obstruction of the execution of governmental duties, I will hereby arrest you.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.820
You there are under suspicion for the same crimes. Drop your weapons immediately!

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:54.700
W-Wait a minute, Hanzou-san!

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:07.170
I guess you won't understand unless you've felt some pain.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.880
Please stop, Hanzou-san!

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:20.560
She's fast...!

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:23.650
Stop-

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:26.520
Wh-What are these chains?

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:30.030
What are you doing? Run away already!

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:31.990
I would, but my body won't move!

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:33.820
Is this the time to be screwing around?!

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.590
Wh-Who in the world is she?

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:55.510
She's acting as if Hanzou were just a child!

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:58.060
On top of that, she hasn't drawn her katana yet.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:01.890
She's strong, but any further failures won't be accepted!

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.690
Please stop this pointless resistance!

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:09.110
This isn't good!

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:11.990
Hanzou-san! Run!

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:26.880
Damn you!

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:47.770
What, these numbers...!

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:50.820
No way, a master samurai?!

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:56.160
All master samurai should be under the management of the Tokugawa household.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.950
I've never seen or heard of a samurai like you.

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:02.660
Stop it!

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.670
STOP!

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:30.940
What's happening?

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:58.590
What in the hell... was that...?

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:07.270
Stop!

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:09.060
The match is already over!

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:10.690
I refuse to show any more mercy!

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:18.200
Restrain yourself, Hanzou! That girl has nothing to do with us!

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:20.280
It's too late for that!

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:22.120
The heavens will have no mercy!

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.620
That's enough!

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.500
C-Could it be...?

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:37.210
By the powers paired with my title of the student council's vice president,

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:41.260
I, Tokugawa Sen, will be handling this helpless situation.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:43.180
Senhime-sama.

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:49.730
One Hour Later

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:52.400
I get the general idea of the whole situation.

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:55.780
Including the crazy girl who came falling from the sky...

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:58.820
Onii-sama will be deciding the ultimate fate of all of you.

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:00.200
Prepare yourselves.

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:03.990
Anyway, Muneakira.

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:07.910
Who would have thought we'd reunite for the first time in 10 years, and under these circumstances...

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.540
Despite the fact that we've known each other since childhood,

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:12.170
I hope you aren't expecting to get away with this one scot-free.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.380
I've no excuse.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:19.300
If "I've no excuse" was enough, don't you think the system of seppuku would've been obsolete ages ago?

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:25.890
Or are you going to entertain me with a good excuse?

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:28.020
Well? Do you have anything you want to say?

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:30.730
No, I don't.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:34.060
Oh? You don't hold your life dearly?

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:39.030
The fact that I disrupted the peace of the academy and caused trouble for Senhime-sama...

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:44.070
As a samurai of the Tokugawa shogunate, I have nothing to say in my defense.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:46.700
Please, dispose of me as you wish.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:49.750
Let me borrow that.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.620
Ohii-sama, what are you-

00:07:56.210 --> 00:08:01.590
No matter what my fate is, if it's a consequence of acting according to my values until the end,

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:03.340
I will accept it without complaint.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:07.810
From the moment I was born into the household of a samurai, I was prepared for this!

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:14.770
Cocky! Way too cocky!

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:17.940
I can't let you use your status to act cool, Muneakira!

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:23.950
Besides, I wrote in the letter to meet me at the station at five in the evening!

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:27.120
Why are you wandering around the city?

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:31.160
If I wrote five o'clock, it's obvious you should be there by three o'clock and wait there <i>gladly</i>,

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:35.460
sitting in proper form with three fingers from each hand touching the ground!

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:40.460
I went there 10 minutes earlier just as I should have, and hid in the shadows while I watched over-

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:42.720
No, wait...!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:47.930
A-Anyway, Muneakira, you're my minion, so you're supposed to do exactly what I tell you to-

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:49.350
Wh-What?!

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:51.680
It's nothing, I'm sorry.

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:55.900
I was just happy that you hadn't changed from 10 years ago, Senhime-sama.

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:00.570
M-My orders are absolute, all right?

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:01.610
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:06.700
It's fine... as long as you understand it.

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.620
Ohii-sama, where are you going?

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:12.870
I'm going to have Onii-sama decide on their punishment.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:17.040
B-But we can't just let that master samurai be...

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:19.090
How much was her power level?

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:20.920
It was 5,000,000!

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:25.010
If that were true, even your bones would be dust right now!

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:28.300
Those glasses are rotten. Go get a new pair!

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:32.560
Th-Th-These glasses are the c-c-culmination of Great Japan's scien-

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:33.310
Shut up!

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:36.890
I bet the whole "falling from the sky" thing was just you seeing things, too!

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:43.110
You, I'm amazed you could keep up relations with this quick-tempered princess from a young age.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:44.780
And you three!

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:49.320
I'm not going to let you set one foot outside of this mansion.

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:51.280
Confinement! Your punishment is confinement!

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:53.830
Same goes for that girl, Jyuubei, or whatever she's called.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.700
Senhime-sama.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:56.910
What?

00:09:56.910 --> 00:10:01.290
The way you use that naginata, and your stance which lacks any error...

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:06.300
I immediately understood that such skill could not be attained without great amounts of practice.

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.510
Good job training for these past 10 years.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:21.400
You haven't changed at all, Muneakira.

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:32.450
If we seal the station and the gate, this academy becomes a complete fortress.

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:36.870
If you enter the forests of Fuji, you'll never get out alive.

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:40.920
I don't know how many more escape routes there are in this mansion,

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:44.090
but I suggest you don't try to think of anything stupid.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:49.220
I'll be calm and quiet then. Thank you for the warning, Hanzou-san.

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:52.890
Muneakira-san, you're cruel.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:11:00.940
Using Ohii-sama's mercy to help out wanted people, then bluffing that you would take any kind of punishment...

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:03.480
I think those kinds of things are unfair!

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:05.860
I guess you're only a shinobi, at best.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:08.320
"Please, dispose of me as you wish."

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:13.320
Those words sounded like those of a samurai,

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:16.910
of a person who was actually prepared to die, to my ears.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.580
Were they not, Muneakira?

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:22.630
What a tough man to deal with.

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:27.050
Well, looks like this was something beyond the comprehension of a shinobi.

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:38.060
Please be quiet!

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:39.850
Muneakira-san aside...

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:45.230
Yukimura-san, Matabei-san, it's already been decided that you will be greatly punished!

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:46.520
Show it!

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:52.860
We heated up the bath. If you'd like, please wash your neck or something.

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:54.910
What kind of a punishment is this?

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:56.450
A-A bath...

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:58.620
Who would go in there of their own accor-

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:00.250
Hey!

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.370
Thank you very much.

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:03.870
Nitwit!

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:06.540
Don't try to go in there of your own accord!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:08.380
But you can see the view outside.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.420
Stop embarrassing me.

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:17.970
Go ahead, go ahead. Please take a dip; that's one person less to deal with.

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:21.520
Stop kidding around! Who would go into something like that?

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.440
I said don't try to go in it!

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:27.190
You really don't know when to give up, as always.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:28.320
"When to give up"?!

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:34.410
With the power of the Sanada army, I could break out of this situation immediately!

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:38.450
The song of the underdogs is pleasing to the ear.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:44.210
I'm staying here because there's something that I want to confirm!

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:47.250
Then how about you confirm it already?

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:49.710
All right, that's enough!

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:55.050
Why was Yukimura on the wanted list?

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:56.430
No idea.

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:58.100
What do you mean "no idea"?

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:02.430
I'm just following Ohii-sama's orders.

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:03.230
You dog.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:06.560
Thank you very much for the kind compliment.

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:10.690
However, I am a guard dog, so if you don't want to get your throat torn to shreds,

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:13.530
I suggest you be careful with your words.

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:17.660
Good girl, you barked! Would you like your own bones as a reward?

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:20.990
Stop, stop!

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:24.160
So what's the reason for you being wanted?

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:29.340
We came all the way here so we could tell the student council the future we saw in the feng shui!

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:30.090
Feng shui?

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:33.590
The crack in the face of this board tells the whole story.

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:35.510
I can't tell just from a crack...

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.470
About a month ago...

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:40.390
I saw an unbelievable future.

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:42.010
An unbelievable future?

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:47.140
The feng shui practitioner in the student council didn't read a foretelling of anything.

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:51.230
Don't think that Sanada's feng shui and Tokugawa's fortune telling games are the same!

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.070
You people are the ones playing around!

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:56.650
I won't forgive you any more.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:58.110
That's my line!

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:03.660
Both of you, that's enough!

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:06.080
Matabei-san, you too! Don't just watch, stop them!

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.540
O-Okay!

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.840
Both of you, just calm down!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:21.430
If the student council put Yukimura on the wanted list, that means they don't think she's just playing around.

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:23.390
That's true...

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:27.140
Yukimura, what in the world did you see?

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:30.060
A shadow.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:34.610
An evil shadow is trying to cover Great Japan.

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:38.780
You!

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:39.320
Stop!

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:42.410
You may not go any further than here!

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:44.200
C-Could it be?

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.660
Go back to your room!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.210
Didn't you hear her?

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:51.710
If you resist, you won't get away with it.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:55.210
What's wrong?

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:59.130
I'm hungry!

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:07.140
I made a lot, so please get as many extra helpings as you want.

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:10.140
Okay! Time for destruction!

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:14.940
A shadow covering Great Japan... can you see one?

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:16.320
No.

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:21.070
Furthermore, as I confirmed earlier, her power level is less than average.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:25.660
Even though she was going over 5,000,000 that time...

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:31.330
Honestly, there are too many unknowns.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:33.790
Yagyuu, the same last name as yours...

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:39.800
And those unsightly chains and lights that appeared when she was in overdrive.

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:40.970
Seconds please!

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:42.180
Here you go.

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:43.590
Hooray!

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:49.310
Wasn't Sanada's feng shui able to see right through anything?

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:52.900
There are things my feng shui cannot see as well!

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:56.570
That's why I warned Tokugawa Sen to investigate it.

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:58.400
Despite all I did, that fool...

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:01.150
What rudeness towards Ohii-sama!

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:02.200
Calm down.

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:03.910
Ahh, that was delicious!

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.910
Thank you for the meal!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.120
You sure are good at cooking, Beta-san!

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:08.870
Beta-san?

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:12.080
Since you're Matabei-san, I'll call you Beta-san!

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:13.500
Don't like it?

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:15.540
I do...

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:18.590
Stop screwing around!

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:22.630
Jyuubei, right? You should be full now.

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:24.890
We're going to have you answer our questions now.

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:26.800
Okay, Yukki.

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:30.600
It's Yukimura! Don't give me strange nicknames!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.390
Well then, Giant Foreheaded Shorty!

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:34.520
What did you say?!

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:36.480
TL Note: Sanada Mushi = Tapeworm.
Then, Tapeworm!

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:43.950
The trauma of being called that when I was a child...!

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.950
Hey, you called yourself Yagyuu Jyuubei...

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:52.080
but that's the name of the swordmaster Yagyuu Jyuubei Mitsuyoshi-sama of the Edo era, right?

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:53.370
Oh, it is?

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:56.710
What do you mean "oh, it is?" You didn't know?

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:57.460
Yup!

00:16:58.500 --> 00:16:59.840
Then where's your birthplace?

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:00.420
Birthplace?

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:03.130
Who are you affiliated with? Your parents' names?

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.630
Hmm...

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:06.800
You don't remember where you're from?

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:07.590
Yep.

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:11.520
Jyuubei was all alone in a dark place.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:16.060
It was cold, lonely, and scary.

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:18.940
But then, I heard a voice!

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:24.280
A warm, strong, and gentle voice.

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:28.870
And then, when I came to, I was in Onii-chan's arms!

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:30.870
Like this!

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:33.160
H-Hey!

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.830
And then, Jyuubei and Onii-chan did this...

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:40.710
Stop!

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:43.550
Onii-chan?

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:48.430
TL Note: "Namu Hachiman Daibosatsu" is a Buddhist prayer.
Namu Hachiman Daibosatsu, Namu Hachiman Daibosatsu...

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:50.430
What's wrong, Onii-chan?

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:55.270
...Namu Hachiman Daibosatsu, Namu Hachiman Daibosatsu!

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:57.190
Paris

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:59.100
Thanks for the report.

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:03.480
Since you're there for me, I can focus on foreign affairs without concern for matters back home, Sen.

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:07.360
It sure is great to have a reliable sister.

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:10.120
I'm glad to be your brother.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:13.660
U-Um, Onii-sama.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:14.660
Hm?

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:19.040
I have a question for you regarding the case with Sanada Yukimura and Gotou Matabei.

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:23.250
Ah, you still can't catch those two?

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:23.800
Yes.

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:28.550
The two only came to warn us regarding a fortune they saw in a feng shui.

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:33.350
In that case, why are you trying to capture them, Onii-sama?

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:35.720
It's a secret.

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:37.850
Please don't try to blow it off.

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:40.690
Oh, that's right.

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:45.480
I'm a little interested in that girl called Jyuubei, so please keep an eye on her.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:48.360
Eh? Onii-sama, I still haven't finished-

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:52.410
Apparently, a girl came falling from the sky.

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:57.160
Don't you think things are getting a little more interesting, Nia?

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:07.380
Yagyuu Dojo

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:09.090
You had better not peep.

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:10.930
I won't.

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:13.510
If you look, you won't get away with it.

